<BaseLayout title="FM26 Tactics and Squad Analysis | FM AI Assistent" description="Load an exported FM26 tactic for role-aware squad-depth analysis, lineup optimization and recruitment context." path="/features/tactics/">
  <div class="page-shell"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Features',href:'/features/'},{label:'Tactics & squad'}]} /><header class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Role-aware analysis</p><h1>Analyze your squad and tactics with AI.</h1><p class="lead">Add an exported FM26 <code>.fmf</code> tactic so the app can decode its shape, roles and instructions into context for squad-depth, lineup and recruitment tools.</p></header>
    <section class="section feature-showcase"><div><h2>Your tactic becomes explicit context.</h2><p>Select a tactic found in the FM26 tactics folder or upload an exported file. A tactic loaded from disk can be remembered locally and reloaded when its file changes.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Diagnose depth against the tactic’s slots and phases</li><li>Build a globally optimized XI without duplicate players</li><li>Recruit against the roles used by a weak tactic slot</li><li>Return a tactic fingerprint with decision responses</li></ul></div><figure class="screenshot-frame"><a href="/images/ai-context.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open the AI context screenshot at full size"><img src="/images/ai-context.png" width="721" height="504" loading="lazy" alt="FM AI Assistent context settings with managed club and FM26 tactic controls" /></a><figcaption><span>Context controls show what can be included in an AI conversation.</span><a href="/images/ai-context.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View full size ↗</a></figcaption></figure></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">What it does—and does not do</p><h2>Analysis, not autopilot.</h2></div><p>The app interprets the tactic and loaded player data. It does not run matches, change instructions in FM26 or guarantee that a lineup will perform.</p></div><div class="comparison"><div class="local"><h3>Useful context</h3><p>Roles, instructions, squad attributes and player availability can make an AI answer specific to your save.</p></div><div class="external"><h3>Manager judgment</h3><p>Dynamics, form, opposition, injuries and incomplete game data still require review inside Football Manager.</p></div></div></section>
  </div><CallToAction eyebrow="Bring your tactic" title="Analyze the squad behind your system." />
</BaseLayout>
